`medium` is defeated too: both Gemini samples found the recurrence, while Terra did not. The current family is therefore vendor-dependent, exactly what the multi-vendor loop is meant to expose. I’ll preserve this transcript until the run finishes, then redesign the fixed-length masking rather than relying on transcription length.
