At `hard`, Gemini again solved and Terra again failed. This confirms the weakness is the exposed two-marker encoding, not insufficient graph size. I’ll replace that encoding with multiple native fixed-label decoy keys while keeping the compact route under 300 operations.
diff --git a/gen_2302_02190.py b/gen_2302_02190.py
